      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss kale, Brussels sprouts, and toasted almonds in a bowl with the dressing. Add Pecorino Romano cheese and serve immediately or allow to sit about 30 minutes for flavors to meld.",
